","helmet":"WP1027305"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"甄逸次子，文昭甄皇后之兄。甄俨被举为孝廉，并被征辟为大将军掾，后出任曲梁长。其子甄像在曹魏身居高位。甄俨本人后被追封为魏昌穆侯。","tc":"甄逸次子，文昭甄皇后之兄。甄儼被舉為孝廉，并被征辟為大將軍掾，后出任曲梁長。其子甄像在曹魏身居高位。甄儼本人后被追封為魏昌穆侯。","en":"The second son of Zhen Yi and elder brother of Empress Wenzhao. Zhen Yan was nominated as Filial and Incorrupt, summoned to serve as an Aide to the Grand General, and later appointed Chief of Quliang. His son, Zhen Xiang, rose to high rank in Cao Wei. Zhen Yan was posthumously enfeoffed as Marquis Mu of Weichang.","jp":"甄逸の次男で、文昭甄皇后の兄。甄儼は孝廉に挙げられ、大将軍掾に辟召された後、曲梁長を務めた。子の甄像は曹魏で高位に就いた。甄儼自身も後に魏昌穆侯を追封された。","kr":"견일의 차남이자 문소견황후의 오라비이다. 효렴으로 천거된 뒤 대장군연으로 징벽되었으며, 이후 곡량장을 지냈다. 아들 견상은 조위에서 고위 관직에 올랐고, 견엄은 훗날 위창목후로 추봉되었다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1038615","remark":"","surname":"甄","surnameTc":"甄","surnameEn":"Zhen","surnameJp":"甄","surnameKr":"견","surnameOther":"","name":"俨","nameTc":"儼","nameEn":"Yan","nameJp":"儼","nameKr":"엄","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"甄俨","power":"WJ10060","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"204","city":"CS1009","gender":"0","rule":"35","force":"25","wise":"65","politics":"70","charm":"60","will":"55","ruleTalent":"5","forceTalent":"4","wiseTalent":"6","politicsTalent":"5","charmTalent":"6","willTalent":"7","weaponMaster":"23/23/25/23/23/66/50/23","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"8000","battleSoulPoint":"4700","debateSoulPoint":"4000","strategy":"","strategy2":"1002005","professions":"3/3/2/1/4/0/3/0/2/0/2/3/1/2/4/1/2/1/1/0/0/2/2/3","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"4","compatible":"57","loyalty":"120","reputation"